WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.525 --> 00:00:16.135
Al Normal ducked, and the hairy creature zoomed past his head.

2
00:00:16.155 --> 00:00:17.577
"Look out!"

3
00:00:18.057 --> 00:00:18.597
he cried.

4
00:00:19.198 --> 00:00:21.660
Startled, some of the monsters ducked too.

5
00:00:25.723 --> 00:00:26.484
is that thing?"

6
00:00:26.764 --> 00:00:27.384
thought Ben.

7
00:00:27.965 --> 00:00:31.448
It looked familiar, but he couldn't remember where he'd seen it before.

8
00:00:32.660 --> 00:00:33.521
"I'll stop it!"

9
00:00:33.861 --> 00:00:34.642
Waldo cried.

10
00:00:35.042 --> 00:00:39.325
He reached into his backpack for a wand as the creature leaped around the lobby.

11
00:00:39.346 --> 00:00:41.627
"Waldo, it's really fast!"

12
00:00:41.988 --> 00:00:42.568
Gaby said.

13
00:00:42.588 --> 00:00:43.589
"Be careful!"

14
00:00:45.851 --> 00:00:51.095
Waldo frowned and put away his wand as the creature raced toward the construction area.

15
00:00:51.795 --> 00:00:53.897
Al Normal's eyes were wide with alarm.

16
00:00:53.917 --> 00:00:56.880
"It's heading for the main part of the museum!"

17
00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.401
"I'll get it!"

18
00:00:58.721 --> 00:00:59.341
Mog said.

19
00:01:00.282 --> 00:01:02.124
He dived at the thing but missed.

20
00:01:03.676 --> 00:01:03.996
"Oof!" Mr.

21
00:01:04.076 --> 00:01:05.236
Freaky looked panicked.

22
00:01:05.857 --> 00:01:07.717
"Now it's running upstairs!"

23
00:01:07.997 --> 00:01:08.577
he wailed.

24
00:01:08.597 --> 00:01:10.998
"Oh, this is a disaster!"

25
00:01:11.018 --> 00:01:14.539
"Uh-oh." Al Normal gulped.

26
00:01:14.559 --> 00:01:17.840
"The museum director's office is up there."

27
00:01:17.860 --> 00:01:20.821
"Students!" commanded Miss Bungle.

28
00:01:20.841 --> 00:01:21.661
"Catch it!"

29
00:01:22.261 --> 00:01:23.762
Ben darted after the creature.

30
00:01:23.782 --> 00:01:26.562
"This isn't good," he thought.

31
00:01:27.222 --> 00:01:30.343
If the creature caused trouble, the monsters would get blamed.

32
00:01:30.843 --> 00:01:32.544
Mayor Hubbletree would be furious!

33
00:01:35.188 --> 00:01:36.849
The thing raced toward an office.

34
00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:40.832
Then—zoom! Something whooshed right over Ben's head.

35
00:01:40.852 --> 00:01:43.714
"Winnie!" Winnie was riding her broom.

36
00:01:46.076 --> 00:01:49.638
She scooped up the hairy creature just before it reached the office door.

37
00:01:49.658 --> 00:01:50.779
"Got it!"

38
00:01:51.239 --> 00:01:53.261
she called, bringing it back to the group.

39
00:01:54.862 --> 00:01:55.923
Al Normal shuddered.

40
00:01:57.564 --> 00:01:59.185
"What is that thing?"

41
00:02:00.046 --> 00:02:00.966
Jen flushed.

42
00:02:01.547 --> 00:02:02.968
"It's mine.

43
00:02:03.644 --> 00:02:06.885
I opened my lunchbox, and my dinner got away!"

44
00:02:07.866 --> 00:02:10.187
Mr. Freaky blew his three noses.

45
00:02:10.207 --> 00:02:13.888
"Put it away, Jen, now!"

46
00:02:14.649 --> 00:02:15.949
Al Normal looked sick.

47
00:02:16.509 --> 00:02:19.551
"You monsters eat things like that?"

48
00:02:20.291 --> 00:02:21.852
Cleo laughed softly.

49
00:02:21.872 --> 00:02:27.874
"Al Normal looks better green," she whispered to Waldo.

50
00:02:28.614 --> 00:02:29.515
Gaby frowned.

51
00:02:29.535 --> 00:02:30.995
"That's rude, Cleo.

52
00:02:31.355 --> 00:02:32.296
He's our host."

53
00:02:34.684 --> 00:02:38.247
A woman dressed in a business suit stood in the doorway of the office.

54
00:02:39.007 --> 00:02:42.490
A construction worker stood nearby, holding a screwdriver.

55
00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:44.831
"D-Dr. Bones!"

56
00:02:45.291 --> 00:02:46.372
Al Normal stammered.

57
00:02:46.392 --> 00:02:48.714
"I'm sorry about the commotion!

58
00:02:49.014 --> 00:02:50.355
It won't happen again."

59
00:02:50.375 --> 00:02:52.937
"Hmpf!" snapped Dr.

60
00:02:52.977 --> 00:02:54.918
Bones. She didn't look happy.

61
00:02:55.779 --> 00:02:58.701
Neither did the construction worker standing near Dr.

62
00:02:58.741 --> 00:03:01.002
Bones. Ben saw him scowl.

63
00:03:02.563 --> 00:03:05.133
"Monsters," muttered the construction worker.

64
00:03:05.153 --> 00:03:06.953
"You can't trust them."

65
00:03:06.973 --> 00:03:09.875
"That's not true," Ben burst out.

66
00:03:09.895 --> 00:03:11.715
"We're just like people!"

67
00:03:12.096 --> 00:03:12.996
Winnie chimed in.

68
00:03:13.016 --> 00:03:15.957
"With a different diet," Jen said.

69
00:03:15.977 --> 00:03:22.360
Al Normal stepped between the monsters and Dr.

70
00:03:22.420 --> 00:03:23.961
Bones to make introductions.

71
00:03:25.881 --> 00:03:28.683
Mr. Freaky and Miss Bungle shook hands with Dr.

72
00:03:28.723 --> 00:03:32.812
Bones. "I'm pleased to meet all of you," Dr.

73
00:03:32.832 --> 00:03:33.512
Bones said.

74
00:03:34.253 --> 00:03:35.713
She looked very serious.

75
00:03:35.733 --> 00:03:43.075
"We'll have to hurry around to the front entrance for the rest of your official greeting," she said.

76
00:03:43.095 --> 00:03:46.936
"The mayor has probably arrived by now.

77
00:03:47.576 --> 00:03:53.858
I'm sorry we can't walk through the museum, but there's still construction in that hallway."

78
00:03:53.878 --> 00:03:58.459
"If you paid us more, we might be done," the construction worker muttered.

79
00:03:59.559 --> 00:04:01.580
Dr. Bones shot him a stern look.

80
00:04:02.268 --> 00:04:05.490
"We've discussed this already," she said.

81
00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:09.151
"You've been paid the amount in your contract.

82
00:04:09.872 --> 00:04:12.073
Now you need to finish the work."

83
00:04:12.093 --> 00:04:17.115
"This job has been harder than we thought," complained the worker.

84
00:04:17.135 --> 00:04:19.436
"It's taking longer too.

85
00:04:19.936 --> 00:04:23.838
If you paid us more, we could hire more workers and finish faster."

86
00:04:25.419 --> 00:04:27.200
Dr. Bones pursed her lips.

87
00:04:28.224 --> 00:04:33.008
"The museum doesn't have any more money for construction right now.

88
00:04:34.670 --> 00:04:38.052
Now please get back to work."

89
00:04:38.733 --> 00:04:42.416
The workman grumbled as he stomped over to the construction area.

90
00:04:45.799 --> 00:04:47.260
Al Normal checked his watch.

91
00:04:48.101 --> 00:04:51.043
"I'll tell the mayor you're coming," he said to Dr.

92
00:04:51.083 --> 00:04:52.264
Bones, hurrying off.

93
00:04:53.625 --> 00:04:56.288
Dr. Bones pointed to several nearby rooms.

94
00:04:56.768 --> 00:05:03.813
"You can leave your sleeping bags and other things in those two classrooms," she told the monsters.

95
00:05:03.833 --> 00:05:10.718
"Be sure to lock your lunchboxes," Miss Bungle added, giving Jen a look.

96
00:05:15.962 --> 00:05:18.663
The monsters put down their things and then followed Dr.

97
00:05:18.703 --> 00:05:20.224
Bones toward the rear entrance.

98
00:05:20.244 --> 00:05:24.928
"I could probably float through all that stuff," Ben thought.

99
00:05:26.284 --> 00:05:26.784
"But Mr.

100
00:05:26.905 --> 00:05:31.227
Freaky would get mad if I didn't stay with the group."

101
00:05:33.629 --> 00:05:35.550
Near the main entrance, Dr.

102
00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:36.831
Bones scratched her head.

103
00:05:37.391 --> 00:05:39.473
"Where are the TV cameras?

104
00:05:40.053 --> 00:05:42.855
I invited a crew from People Place News."

105
00:05:43.696 --> 00:05:44.436
Ben looked up.

106
00:05:44.977 --> 00:05:47.838
The only person waiting to greet them was Mayor Hubbletree.

107
00:05:51.441 --> 00:05:52.622
He hurried up to Dr.

108
00:05:52.662 --> 00:05:57.332
Bones. "I sent the news crew home," the mayor explained.

109
00:05:57.913 --> 00:06:01.394
"After all, some people are unhappy about this field trip.

110
00:06:01.954 --> 00:06:06.396
They don't like the idea of monsters staying overnight in People Place."

111
00:06:06.416 --> 00:06:09.298
"Ridiculous," Dr.

112
00:06:09.338 --> 00:06:10.058
Bones muttered.

113
00:06:10.698 --> 00:06:14.740
Mr. Freaky pulled out his handkerchief and blew his noses a few times.

114
00:06:19.662 --> 00:06:21.763
"Monsters!" he said to the students.

115
00:06:21.783 --> 00:06:24.304
"What do we say to Mayor Hubbletree?"

116
00:06:25.280 --> 00:06:28.784
"Good afternoon, Mayor," the monsters chanted.

117
00:06:28.804 --> 00:06:32.207
"Thank you for inviting us to People Place."

118
00:06:33.028 --> 00:06:35.371
Mayor Hubbletree flashed a quick smile.

119
00:06:35.391 --> 00:06:39.775
"Welcome to the People Place Museum," he said.

120
00:06:39.795 --> 00:06:44.220
"We're all um, delighted to have you here."

121
00:06:45.821 --> 00:06:47.503
Then he leaned close to Mr.

122
00:06:47.543 --> 00:06:48.244
Freaky's ear.

123
00:06:48.748 --> 00:06:55.225
"This field trip better not cause any problems, Freaky, or I'll knock down Monster Academy with my own

124
00:06:55.365 --> 00:06:56.348
bare hands!"
